I never thought it would happen to me!  I just started a game with a
tourist, and in the very first room, two spaces away was a wand of
wishing.

I have never found a WOW outside of the castle in all my years of
nethacking before.  Amazing.  I think Ill cry if I lose this game.

I take it I should NOT wish for the blessed Plat Y card to recharge it,
so as to not screw up my quest?  I already wished for a blessed
figure of an Archon, the best idea in this situation.

The intersting thing is, I was playing tourist only becuz I wanted
automatic magic mapping scrolls to search for fountains.  I have
started and quickly quit a few hundred games in the last two days
trying to quaff at a fountain just to get ONE wish from a water
demon, and here I get a WOW on the first level.  Oh my.  I think
I might try going w/o wishing for a charging scroll, and hope I can
find one w/o wasting a wish on it.  What do you guys think of that
plan?  I purposely have set up a bones level of an old wizard of mine
on level 5 with a athame and a WoPoly (all of it dropped on the
ground so it doesnt get cursed, heh heh).

Needless to say, I will be VERY careful in this game!!

